+
+```ts
+export function resolvePointer(document: unknown, pointer: string): unknown
+```
+
+Returns the referenced value (same reference, no copy). Throws `Error` if the pointer is invalid (FR-003, FR-004, FR-010) or does not resolve (FR-006..FR-008). See spec.md for the full rules.
